Use [code][entity, false] call ADG_fnc_allowDamage;[/code] to disable damage for an entity in multiplayer. Pass [b]true[/b] to enable it again.

The addon reapplies the selected state when ownership moves between the server, a client or a headless client. For example, a vehicle set to invulnerable stays invulnerable when a player gets in and takes ownership. Players who join later receive the current state.

[url=https://github.com/Dschitarre/a3-dev/tree/master/src/mods/allowdamageglobal]Source code[/url]
